msgid "构建系统架构审查与重构方案"
msgstr "Build architecture review and refactoring plan"

msgid ""
"本方案供应用开发者、SoC 接入者和构建维护者审查。审查基线是 Nexus 提交 `5e0b512c`。建议保留 CMake "
"3.31、Ninja、静态实例和现有应用入口，依次改进配置数据交接、增量失效和新 MCU 接入。下文的 BR1–BR7 是待实施工作，B01–B11 "
"已规定验证流程和时间目标。[现行构建合同与验证计划](build-system.md#verification-plan-for-additional-"
"mcu-families)"
msgstr ""
"This review covers how application developers, SoC port authors and build "
"maintainers use Nexus at revision `5e0b512c`. The proposal retains CMake "
"3.31, Ninja, static instances and the existing application entry points. It "
"first improves how configuration data reaches CMake, then how the build "
"detects changes and how new MCUs join the platform. BR1–BR7 below are open "
"tasks. B01–B11 define the verification workflow and timing targets. [Current"
" build contract and verification plan](build-system.md#verification-plan-"
"for-additional-mcu-families)"

msgid "从应用配置到可烧录镜像"
msgstr "From application configuration to a flashable image"

msgid ""
"**选择构建环境。** 应用 preset 在首次 configure 前选择 Ninja、工具链、独立 binary directory 和 "
"`NEXUS_ASSEMBLY_FILE`。工具链负责定位编译器与交叉编译环境。配置解析后，平台把确切 CPU、FPU、浮点 ABI "
"和优化选项施加到相关目标。一个构建目录对应一套 assembly "
"和工具链，同一套配置可以创建多个固件目标。[工具链](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/toolchains/arm-gcc.cmake) · "
"[目标编译选项](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/platform/Options.cmake)"
msgstr ""
"**Select the build environment.** Before the first configure, the "
"application preset selects Ninja, the toolchain, a separate binary directory"
" and `NEXUS_ASSEMBLY_FILE`. The toolchain locates the compiler and sets up "
"cross-compilation. Once configuration resolves, the platform applies the "
"selected CPU, FPU, floating-point ABI and optimization flags to the relevant"
" targets. Each build directory owns one assembly and toolchain. Multiple "
"firmware targets can use that configuration. "
"[Toolchain](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/toolchains/arm-gcc.cmake) · [Target compile "
"options](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/platform/Options.cmake)"

msgid ""
"**解析硬件意图。** 开发者编写 TOML，选择板卡、后端、组件和 I/O 实例。主机 resolver 结合 Board、SoC 事实及 "
"binding 检查资源和合法模式，从同一份类型化结果原子生成静态 C、factory 头、链接脚本、CMake 选择数据与审查用 "
"JSON。它还记录事实和工具输入，让 CMake "
"知道何时应重新配置。失败与输出内容相同各有既定的发布语义。[配置接线](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Configure.cmake) · "
"[生成端](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/emission.py)"
msgstr ""
"**Resolve the hardware configuration.** The developer selects a board, "
"backend, components and I/O instances in TOML. The host resolver checks "
"resources and supported modes against board and SoC facts and bindings. From"
" one typed result it atomically publishes static C, factory headers, the "
"linker script, CMake selection data and JSON for review. It records fact and"
" tool inputs so CMake knows when to reconfigure. Publication has defined "
"behavior for both failure and unchanged output. [Configuration "
"integration](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/platform/Configure.cmake) · "
"[Generator](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/emission.py)"

msgid ""
"**建立目标图。** 根 CMake 接入 Core、Arch、I/O、OS、组件及选中的 SoC 包。包的 CMake 决定具体模式对应哪些 C "
"源码和厂商库。生成的 `bindings.c` 编入 "
"`Nexus::Platform`，组件使用公共领域接口。固件入口负责将应用、平台、启动对象和链接脚本连成可执行文件。Ninja "
"按依赖执行编译、链接和产物检查。[根入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/CMakeLists.txt) · [provider "
"合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/platform/Provider.cmake) · [固件目标](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Firmware.cmake)"
msgstr ""
"**Construct the target graph.** The root CMake file brings in Core, Arch, "
"I/O, OS, components and the selected SoC package. The package's CMake rules "
"select C sources and vendor libraries for each mode. Generated `bindings.c` "
"compiles into `Nexus::Platform`. Components use public domain interfaces. "
"The firmware entry point links the application, platform and startup objects"
" with the selected linker script. Ninja follows the dependency graph to "
"compile, link and check artifacts. [Root entry "
"point](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/CMakeLists.txt) · [Provider contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Provider.cmake) · "
"[Firmware target](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Firmware.cmake)"

msgid ""
"**交付与消费。** 外部工程通过源码或已安装的 Source SDK 取得同一套公共目标。SDK "
"还要验证内容身份、搬迁后的路径、编译接口、链接和资源。CPU Runtime "
"入口供调用方自行负责启动与板级集成。其产物与物理板卡固件有不同的责任边界。[SDK 入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/package/NexusConfig.cmake.in) · [SDK 教程](../tutorials/source-"
"sdk.md) · [CPU Runtime](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Runtime.cmake)"
msgstr ""
"**Deliver and consume the platform.** External projects get the same public "
"targets from a source checkout or an installed Source SDK. SDK verification "
"also checks content identity, relocated paths, compilation interfaces, "
"linkage and resources. Callers of the CPU Runtime entry point own startup "
"and board integration. This gives a CPU Runtime artifact a different scope "
"from firmware built for a physical board. [SDK entry "
"point](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/package/NexusConfig.cmake.in) · [SDK "
"tutorial](../tutorials/source-sdk.md) · [CPU "
"Runtime](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/platform/Runtime.cmake)"

msgid "![配置、静态实例与固件产物的关系](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![Configuration, static instances and firmware "
"artifacts](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)"

msgid "配置、静态实例与固件产物的关系"
msgstr "Configuration, static instances and firmware artifacts"

msgid ""
"应用只需提供 assembly 与应用源文件。以下 Source SDK 示例假定 preset "
"已设置工具链、`NEXUS_ASSEMBLY_FILE` 和 SDK 的 `CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH` 或 "
"`Nexus_DIR`，应用也已调用 `project()`。源码消费通过 `add_subdirectory` 接入平台，随后调用相同的固件函数。"
msgstr ""
"An application supplies its assembly and application sources. The following "
"Source SDK example assumes the preset sets the toolchain, "
"`NEXUS_ASSEMBLY_FILE` and the SDK location through `CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH` or "
"`Nexus_DIR`, and that the application has called `project()`. Source "
"consumers add the platform via `add_subdirectory` and use the same firmware "
"function."

msgid "实测成本与优化顺序"
msgstr "Measured costs and optimization priorities"

msgid ""
"在独立构建目录运行 `stm32-qiming-baremetal` preset，以两个并行任务构建 `nexus_firmware`。首次 "
"configure 针对 ControllerModes 开启了 CMake "
"trace。下表是同一工作区的一次观察，包含主机缓存和跟踪开销。时间用于定位方向，后续产品验收应使用相同环境、无跟踪的重复样本。"
msgstr ""
"The `stm32-qiming-baremetal` preset built `nexus_firmware` with two parallel"
" jobs in a separate build directory. The first configure enabled CMake "
"tracing for ControllerModes. These measurements come from one run in the "
"same workspace and include the effects of host caches and tracing. They "
"identify areas to investigate. Product acceptance should use repeated "
"measurements in the same environment with tracing off."

msgid "观察项"
msgstr "Operation"

msgid "实测"
msgstr "Measurement"

msgid "工程含义"
msgstr "Engineering implication"

msgid "首次 configure"
msgstr "Initial configure"

msgid "4.144 秒，同一模块读取 resolved.json 35 次"
msgstr "4.144 s, with 35 reads of resolved.json by the same module"

msgid "消除各 IP 模块重复解析同一选择结果，收益须以对照组复测"
msgstr ""
"Avoid parsing the same selection for each IP module. Measure the gain "
"against a control run."

msgid "首次编译与链接"
msgstr "Initial compile and link"

msgid "3.278 秒，固件闭包 44 条编译命令"
msgstr ""
"3.278 s, with 44 compilation commands in the firmware dependency closure"

msgid "全目录编译数据库有 149 条记录，单固件的实际工作应查 Ninja 目标闭包"
msgstr ""
"The compilation database for the entire directory contains 149 entries. "
"Inspect the Ninja target's dependency closure to determine the work for one "
"firmware image."

msgid "原输入直接再次构建"
msgstr "Rebuild directly with identical inputs"

msgid "0.224 秒，零编译、零链接"
msgstr "0.224 s, with no compilation or linking"

msgid "保留 Ninja 热路径，优先处理总是先 configure 的包装入口"
msgstr ""
"Keep Ninja's incremental path and address wrappers that always configure "
"first."

msgid "仅删除临时树中的 BIN"
msgstr "Delete only the BIN in the temporary build tree"

msgid "0.938 秒；直接构建固件恢复 BIN，ELF 与 BIN 各自与原件字节相同"
msgstr ""
"0.938 s. Building the firmware target restored the BIN. The ELF and BIN each"
" matched their original bytes."

msgid "产物重建与预算检查是用户依赖的行为，拆分链接后处理时需保住它"
msgstr ""
"Callers rely on artifact recovery and budget checks. Preserve both if post-"
"link processing is split up."

msgid ""
"在同一目录随后执行五轮无跟踪的热构建对照。显式重复 configure 的中位数为 2.932 秒，随后构建的中位数为 0.157 "
"秒；直接增量构建的中位数为 0.156 秒。十次构建均报告无需执行任务。此结果量化了这个样本中包装脚本多请求一次配置的成本。"
msgstr ""
"Five subsequent warm-build comparisons ran without tracing in the same "
"directory. Explicit reconfiguration took a median of 2.932 s, followed by a "
"build taking a median of 0.157 s. The direct incremental build took a median"
" of 0.156 s. All ten builds reported no work. This measures the cost of a "
"wrapper requesting an extra configure for this sample."

msgid ""
"相邻已验证基线的完整本地门禁耗时 30 分 04 秒，其中辅助工具约 28 分 45 秒。此处的 F407 "
"构建只针对一个固件，两者的目标集合不同。日常驱动反馈 3 分钟、板卡反馈 5 分钟属于验证流水线的 P95 目标。配置优化的收益按 configure "
"时间、重配次数、编译及链接边数分别报告。[计时范围、工具分解及验收条件](build-system.md#verification-plan-for-"
"additional-mcu-families)"
msgstr ""
"The complete local gate on the adjacent verified baseline took 30 min 04 s, "
"including about 28 min 45 s for auxiliary tools. The F407 build measured "
"here targets one firmware image. The verification pipeline's p95 targets are"
" 3 minutes for routine driver changes and 5 minutes for board changes. "
"Report configure time, reconfiguration count and the numbers of compile and "
"link edges separately. [Timing scope, tool breakdown and acceptance "
"criteria](build-system.md#verification-plan-for-additional-mcu-families)"

msgid "目标架构与修改边界"
msgstr "Target architecture and change boundaries"

msgid ""
"**选择事实只传一次。** 当前 F4 CMake 包含多个 IP 片段，`nexus_controller_values` 每次调用均读取 JSON "
"并遍历控制器。建议把构图实际消费的类别、控制器和模式按需投影进已有 `selection.cmake`，从同一 IR "
"一次生成。用经校验的标识、稳定顺序、空集和正确的 CMake 列表转义覆盖用户输入。CMake 继续拥有源码、目标、可见性与链接边。审查工具继续使用 "
"`resolved.json`。先迁移 UART 与 "
"SPI，核对编译命令和镜像，再迁移余下调用者。[现有查询](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/ControllerModes.cmake) · [F4 "
"构图入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/CMakeLists.txt)"
msgstr ""
"**Pass selection facts once.** F4 CMake currently includes several IP "
"fragments. Each call to `nexus_controller_values` reads JSON and traverses "
"the controllers. Generate just the categories, controllers and modes "
"consumed by the graph in the existing `selection.cmake`, once from the same "
"IR. Handle user input with validated identifiers, stable ordering, explicit "
"empty selections and correct CMake list escaping. CMake owns source files, "
"targets, visibility and link dependencies. Review tools consume "
"`resolved.json`. Migrate UART and SPI first, compare compile commands and "
"firmware images, then migrate the remaining callers. [Current "
"query](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/platform/ControllerModes.cmake) · [F4 graph entry "
"point](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/CMakeLists.txt)"

msgid ""
"**让构建合同可见。** 根入口当前将 11 个环境和启动属性发布给固件函数，消费端再分别读取并检查其中 5 "
"个必需属性。应在现有模块中集中定义这项内部合同，区分通用必需项、物理目标必需项及可选项。API、编译定义与头目录按实际消费者使用 "
"PUBLIC、PRIVATE 或 "
"INTERFACE。厂商头和启动宏只进入需要它们的目标。验证直接属性之外，还应实际编译外部消费者，以检查经依赖传递的使用要求。[目标发布端](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/CMakeLists.txt) · "
"[固件消费端](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/platform/Firmware.cmake)"
msgstr ""
"**Make the build contract explicit.** The root entry point currently "
"publishes 11 environment and startup properties to the firmware function. "
"Its consumer reads them individually and checks five required properties. "
"Define this internal contract once in the existing modules and distinguish "
"generally required properties, properties required by physical targets and "
"optional properties. Give APIs, compile definitions and include directories "
"PUBLIC, PRIVATE or INTERFACE scope according to their consumers. Restrict "
"vendor headers and startup macros to the targets that need them. Compile an "
"external consumer to verify transitive usage requirements as well as direct "
"properties. [Target property producer](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/CMakeLists.txt) · [Firmware "
"consumer](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/platform/Firmware.cmake)"

msgid ""
"**把失效范围交给真正的输入。** Board、芯片事实、binding 或解析器变化应重新求解；生成内容相同则保持文件时间戳。普通 C 变更使用编译器"
" "
"depfile。链接脚本或实际对象变化触发链接。预算与检查器变化必须重新验证产物。当前固件把配置实现文件也列为链接依赖，直接删去依赖会让部分检查丢失。应先用产物缺失、预算缩紧、解析器改动但生成内容相同、链接脚本实际变化四种情形验证，再缩小依赖。工作区与外部示例的热构建均应保留路径切换、失败恢复及并发隔离。[固件依赖和产物](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Firmware.cmake) · "
"[当前门禁入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/scripts/ci/tdd_gate.py)"
msgstr ""
"**Invalidate outputs when their inputs change.** Changes to a board, chip "
"facts, bindings or the resolver must trigger resolution. Preserve timestamps"
" when generated bytes are unchanged. Use compiler depfiles for ordinary C "
"changes. Relink when the linker script or object files change and revalidate"
" artifacts when budgets or their checker change. The firmware target "
"currently lists configuration implementation files as link dependencies. "
"Removing them outright could suppress required checks. Before narrowing "
"these dependencies, test a missing artifact, a tighter budget, a resolver "
"change with identical generated output and a changed linker script. Warm "
"builds in the workspace and in external examples must still handle path "
"changes, recover from failure and isolate concurrent runs. [Firmware "
"dependencies and artifacts](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Firmware.cmake) · [Current gate entry "
"point](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/scripts/ci/tdd_gate.py)"

msgid ""
"**让新增 MCU 的修改留在所属包。** 同家族同 IP 的新型号通常增加型号、封装、内存、路由、启动与 SDK 身份；复用家族 CMake "
"和驱动。新 IP 在所属家族增加驱动、binding、局部选编和合同测试。新厂商包提供自己的 facts、provider 目标、startup 和 "
"SDK 清单。新架构或 ABI 才涉及 Arch 或工具链扩展。当前生成器存在 STM32 专用选项，SDK 的必备文件检查还直接列出 F407 "
"头及启动文件。把这些假设移入选中包的元数据，以另一款 F4 和外置 provider "
"分别检验同家族与跨包接入成本。[生成器](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/emission.py) · [SDK "
"打包与校验](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/package/package_source_sdk.py) · [provider "
"接入](../guides/provider-porting.md)"
msgstr ""
"**Keep MCU-specific changes in the owning package.** A new part with "
"existing IP in the same family normally adds part, package, memory, route, "
"startup and SDK identity data, reusing the family CMake rules and drivers. "
"New IP adds a driver, binding, local source selection and contract tests in "
"the family package. A new vendor package supplies its own facts, provider "
"target, startup and SDK manifest. A new architecture or ABI may require Arch"
" or toolchain extensions. The generator currently has STM32-specific options"
" and the SDK required-file checks name the F407 header and startup file "
"directly. Move those assumptions into the selected package's metadata, then "
"use another F4 part and an external provider to test the cost of same-family"
" and cross-package integration. [Generator](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/emission.py) · "
"[SDK packaging and verification](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/package/package_source_sdk.py) · [Provider "
"porting](../guides/provider-porting.md)"

msgid ""
"**简化入口和组件登记。** 根文件保留配置、层级、provider、平台和可选开发入口。工作负载、度量或测试接线移回已有的 Workload 或 "
"tests 所属位置。组件公共标识属于配置合同，标识到目标的映射和依赖属于 CMake。标准 CMake 调用保留在所属叶目录。组件目录使用 "
"EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL "
"仍会被配置，应先计时，再决定是否延迟加载，并验证手动链接公共组件的现有用法。[组件装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Components.cmake) ·"
" [组件入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/CMakeLists.txt) · [工作负载](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Workload.cmake)"
msgstr ""
"**Simplify entry points and component registration.** The root file keeps "
"configuration, layer ordering, provider and platform integration, and "
"optional development entry points. Move workload, measurement and test "
"integration back to the existing Workload module or tests, as appropriate. "
"Public component identifiers belong to the configuration contract. Their "
"target mappings and dependencies belong to CMake. Keep ordinary CMake calls "
"in the owning leaf directory. A component directory marked EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL "
"still configures. Measure before adopting lazy loading and verify existing "
"applications that link public components explicitly. [Component "
"composition](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/platform/Components.cmake) · [Component entry "
"point](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/CMakeLists.txt) · [Workloads](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Workload.cmake)"

msgid ""
"以下是目标职责布局，绝大多数目录已存在。日常接入按修改的责任定位文件。应用作者只需学习 preset、TOML "
"与固件函数；平台维护者才需要进入后面的工具和模块。"
msgstr ""
"The intended directory responsibilities follow. Most of these directories "
"already exist. Choose files by the responsibility being changed. Application"
" authors need the preset, TOML and firmware function. The underlying tools "
"and modules are for platform maintainers."

msgid "目录"
msgstr "Directory"

msgid "维护职责"
msgstr "Maintenance responsibility"

msgid "`CMakeLists.txt`"
msgstr "`CMakeLists.txt`"

msgid "入口、装配顺序、公共目标"
msgstr "Entry point, composition order and public targets"

msgid "`cmake/presets/`、`cmake/toolchains/`"
msgstr "`cmake/presets/`, `cmake/toolchains/`"

msgid "开发与验证入口；交叉编译环境与工具发现"
msgstr ""
"Development and verification entry points, cross-compilation environment and"
" tool discovery"

msgid "`cmake/platform/`、`cmake/package/`"
msgstr "`cmake/platform/`, `cmake/package/`"

msgid "配置接线、目标策略、固件和 Runtime；Source SDK 打包、导入与消费验证"
msgstr ""
"Configuration integration, target policy, firmware and Runtime. Source SDK "
"packaging, import and consumer verification."

msgid "`tools/configure/`、`boards/`"
msgstr "`tools/configure/`, `boards/`"

msgid "通用解析、校验和生成；板级事实与接线"
msgstr "Common resolution, validation and generation. Board facts and wiring."

msgid "`soc/<vendor>/<family>/`"
msgstr "`soc/<vendor>/<family>/`"

msgid "家族事实、system、drivers、sdk 与局部 CMake"
msgstr "Family facts, system, drivers, SDK and package-local CMake"

msgid "`core/`、`arch/`、`io/`、`os/`、`components/`"
msgstr "`core/`, `arch/`, `io/`, `os/`, `components/`"

msgid "各自拥有源码和目标依赖"
msgstr "Each directory owns its sources and target dependencies"

msgid "`tests/`"
msgstr "`tests/`"

msgid "主机验证、模型与测试图"
msgstr "Host verification, models and the test target graph"

msgid "可借鉴的实现"
msgstr "Patterns from other build systems"

msgid ""
"**Zephyr** 将配置阶段生成的文件作为编译输入，并让构建执行器运行已生成的依赖图。Nexus 可沿用这个阶段边界。现有 TOML、类型化 IR "
"和静态 factory 已满足当前单镜像用例；多镜像拥有独立配置与链接边界时，再评估 sysbuild 式上层编排。[Zephyr v4.2.0 "
"构建阶段](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/v4.2.0/doc/build/cmake/index.rst#L50-L99) · "
"[Sysbuild](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/v4.2.0/doc/build/sysbuild/index.rst#L32-L75)"
msgstr ""
"**Zephyr** compiles files produced during configuration and delegates "
"execution of the resulting dependency graph to the build tool. Nexus can "
"adopt this division of responsibility. TOML, the typed IR and the static "
"factory already cover the current single-image use case. Consider sysbuild-"
"style orchestration when multiple images need independent configuration and "
"linking. [Zephyr v4.2.0 build phases](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/v4.2.0/doc/build/cmake/index.rst#L50-L99) · "
"[Sysbuild](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/v4.2.0/doc/build/sysbuild/index.rst#L32-L75)"

msgid ""
"**ESP-IDF** 让组件区分公开和私有依赖，能从消费端判断哪些头及编译要求应传递。Nexus 可直接用 CMake 目标表达同一原则，把厂商 "
"includes、HAL 定义与启动参数留在 provider 内。验证用最小外部应用，直接检查其编译命令和包含可见性。[ESP-IDF v5.4.2 "
"组件依赖](https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/v5.4.2/docs/en/api-"
"guides/build-system.rst#L448-L474)"
msgstr ""
"**ESP-IDF** components distinguish public and private dependencies, making "
"it clear which headers and compile requirements propagate to consumers. "
"Nexus can express the same distinction with CMake targets and keep vendor "
"include paths, HAL definitions and startup arguments private to the "
"provider. Verify the result by inspecting the compile commands for a minimal"
" external application and the headers it can include. [ESP-IDF v5.4.2 "
"component dependencies](https://github.com/espressif/esp-"
"idf/blob/v5.4.2/docs/en/api-guides/build-system.rst#L448-L474)"

msgid ""
"**CMake 与 Ninja** 分别提供工具链边界、重新配置依赖、输出与副产物规则，以及目标增量执行。Nexus "
"的脚本负责准备环境、选择测试、报告结果。热路径优先调用已配置的目标，保持原生命令和应用 API 相同的产物保证。[CMake 3.31 "
"工具链](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/v3.31/manual/cmake-"
"toolchains.7.html#cross-compiling) · "
"[重新配置依赖](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/v3.31/prop_dir/CMAKE_CONFIGURE_DEPENDS.html)"
" · "
"[产物声明](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/v3.31/command/add_custom_command.html) ·"
" [Ninja 1.12.1 依赖](https://github.com/ninja-"
"build/ninja/blob/v1.12.1/doc/manual.asciidoc#L638-L659)"
msgstr ""
"**CMake and Ninja** have complementary roles. CMake defines the toolchain, "
"reconfiguration dependencies, outputs and byproducts. Ninja builds targets "
"incrementally. Nexus scripts prepare the environment, select tests and "
"report results. Warm builds should invoke already configured targets and "
"give native commands and the application API the same artifact guarantees. "
"[CMake 3.31 toolchains](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/v3.31/manual/cmake-"
"toolchains.7.html#cross-compiling) · [Reconfiguration "
"dependencies](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/v3.31/prop_dir/CMAKE_CONFIGURE_DEPENDS.html)"
" · [Declaring "
"outputs](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/v3.31/command/add_custom_command.html)"
" · [Ninja 1.12.1 dependencies](https://github.com/ninja-"
"build/ninja/blob/v1.12.1/doc/manual.asciidoc#L638-L659)"

msgid "迭代任务与验收"
msgstr "Implementation tasks and acceptance criteria"

msgid ""
"**BR1，基线与回归样本。** 构建维护者先冻结一组小样本，包括 F407 裸机、同板 RTOS、Native、独立 CPU Runtime "
"和搬迁后的 Source SDK。记录 revision、工具版本、并行度及冷热条件，分别测 configure、首次构建、无修改、单 C 文件和只改 "
"TOML。沿用 B01 的报告；以 Ninja 实际执行、map、Flash/RAM 和产物身份建立比较基准。"
msgstr ""
"**BR1. Establish the baseline and regression cases.** Build maintainers "
"should freeze a small set of cases covering bare-metal F407, an RTOS on the "
"same board, Native, standalone CPU Runtime and a relocated Source SDK. "
"Record the revision, tool versions, parallelism and cold or warm conditions."
" Measure configuration, the first build, a no-change rebuild, a single C "
"file edit and a TOML-only edit separately. Reuse the B01 report. Record the "
"commands Ninja actually runs, the linker map, Flash and RAM usage, and "
"artifact identities as the comparison baseline."

msgid ""
"**BR2，收敛根入口与目标合同。** 在 BR1 后提取工作负载和测试装配，集中生产与消费端共同使用的属性；保留原生 "
"preset、目标别名和应用函数。用真实消费者覆盖缺 startup、缺必需目标、应用请求 C++、Native 及 "
"Runtime。编译器和工具按启用语言或实际度量需求查找。退出条件是等价配置的 ABI、向量、段布局和资源预算一致，应用编译命令不暴露厂商私有目录。"
msgstr ""
"**BR2. Simplify the root entry point and centralize target contracts.** "
"After BR1, extract workload and test assembly and centralize the properties "
"shared by producers and consumers. Preserve native presets, target aliases "
"and application functions. Use real consumers to exercise missing startup "
"code, a missing required target, an application requesting C++, Native and "
"Runtime. Discover compilers and tools according to the enabled language or "
"the measurement that needs them. Equivalent configurations must have "
"matching ABIs, vectors, section layouts and resource budgets, and "
"application compile commands must keep vendor-private directories out of "
"their include paths."

msgid ""
"**BR3，消除构图时重复解析。** 可与 BR2 并行。配置维护者从 UART、SPI "
"开始建立最小选择投影，迁移查询，最后清除失去消费者的旧助手。验收空配置、多控制器、重复模式、特殊字符和无关模式裁剪。完成后本样本在 "
"ControllerModes 中读取 resolved.json 的次数从 35 降到 0，直接比较实际选中对象、符号、生成文件时间戳及 "
"configure 耗时。配合 B05 做缓存边界验证。"
msgstr ""
"**BR3. Eliminate repeated parsing during graph construction.** This work can"
" proceed alongside BR2. Configuration maintainers should start with UART and"
" SPI, emit only the selection data these targets consume, migrate their "
"queries and remove obsolete helpers once they have no callers. Test an empty"
" configuration, multiple controllers, repeated modes, special characters and"
" pruning of unrelated modes. The baseline case should go from 35 reads of "
"resolved.json in ControllerModes to zero. Compare the actual selected "
"objects, symbols, timestamps of generated files and configuration times. "
"Coordinate cache invalidation checks with B05."

msgid ""
"**BR4，恢复原生增量路径。** BR1 后先修复总是 configure 的调用方，再处理固件链接和预算的失效边界。变更工具链、生成器、源码或 "
"SDK 路径须能识别或要求新的构建目录。验收无修改零编译零链接、单 C 文件只重编对应对象及受影响链接、删除 BIN "
"可直接恢复、降低预算时原命令失败、失败后重试成功。按 B03 分别测平台和外部示例。"
msgstr ""
"**BR4. Restore native incremental builds.** After BR1, fix callers that "
"always run configuration, then define which changes must trigger firmware "
"linking and budget checks. Detect changes to the toolchain, generator, "
"source path or SDK path, or require a new build directory. Verify that a no-"
"change build compiles and links nothing, an edit to one C file recompiles "
"its object and relinks only affected targets, rebuilding the firmware "
"restores a deleted BIN, and the original command fails after the budget is "
"tightened. Verify that retrying succeeds once the failure is corrected. "
"Measure the platform and external examples separately under B03."

msgid ""
"**BR5，去掉通用层内的器件假设。** BR3 后由 SoC 与 SDK "
"维护者把设备头、启动文件和家族特有选择归属到已有包；保留供应商锁与许可证。先用第二个已支持 F4 精确料号，再用外置 provider "
"走同一入口。删除该型号专属启动文件必须失败；只加同 IP 型号时通用 resolver、根 CMake 和 SDK 校验器的型号分支改动数为零。对应 "
"B08、B09；模型与软件交付不授予实板资格。"
msgstr ""
"**BR5. Remove device assumptions from common code.** After BR3, SoC and SDK "
"maintainers should assign device headers, startup files and family-specific "
"choices to the existing packages and retain vendor locks and licenses. "
"Exercise the same entry point first with a second supported F4 part number, "
"then with an external provider. Removing the startup file for that part must"
" cause a failure. Adding another part with the same IP must require zero "
"changes to part-specific branches in the generic resolver, root CMake and "
"SDK verifier. Coordinate this work with B08 and B09. Models and software "
"delivery provide separate evidence from board qualification."

msgid ""
"**BR6，缩减可选成本。** 依 BR1 数据决定是否更改组件加载或复用启动对象。目前启明 V4.1 的裸机和 FreeRTOS "
"样本中，同配置双固件各自编译同一组四个启动对象。仅在生效的编译选项、目录属性、ABI 和 assembly 全部相同时考虑在该构建目录共享。每个 ELF"
" 仍各自链接、校验向量及预算；若实测收益不足以覆盖复杂度，保留现有实现并记录结果。"
msgstr ""
"**BR6. Reduce optional build costs.** Use BR1 measurements to decide whether"
" to change component loading or share startup objects. In both the bare-"
"metal and FreeRTOS Qiming V4.1 cases, two firmware targets with the same "
"configuration each compile the same four startup objects. Consider sharing "
"those objects within that build directory only when the effective compile "
"options, directory properties, ABI and assembly all match. Link each ELF "
"separately and verify its vectors and budget. Keep the current "
"implementation and record the outcome if the measured benefit does not "
"justify the complexity."

msgid ""
"**BR7，外部消费和迁移收尾。** BR2–BR5 的等价对照通过后，按 B07、B10、B11 执行相关 SDK "
"消费者、受限并发和集成对照。保留源码接入、重复导入 SDK "
"时的完整性检查、干净搬迁和正式离线复现。文档给出首次创建、热重建和移植新型号的最短操作。各批独立提交；发现漏编、漏检或增量误判即可回退对应批次并复用基线样本重现。"
msgstr ""
"**BR7. Complete external consumption and migration.** Once BR2–BR5 pass "
"their equivalence checks, run the affected SDK consumers, bounded "
"concurrency checks and integration comparisons under B07, B10 and B11. "
"Preserve source-based integration, integrity checks on repeated SDK imports,"
" clean relocation and formal offline reproduction. Document the shortest "
"working steps to create a project, rebuild a warm tree and port another "
"part. Commit each batch independently so a missed compilation, omitted check"
" or incorrect incremental decision can be reproduced against the baseline "
"and the corresponding batch reverted."

msgid ""
"日常以无修改构建、普通驱动修改、板卡修改三条路径评估开发体验；交付以可直接构建的固件目标、独立应用、SDK "
"和复现验证评估正确性。同一工具链下，等价配置出现 Flash、RAM 或符号变化应逐项解释。只有重复实测的 "
"P95、命令与产物都满足对应边界，才能把性能目标登记为已达成。"
msgstr ""
"For everyday development, assess the no-change build, an ordinary driver "
"edit and a board edit. For delivery, verify firmware targets that build "
"directly, independent applications, SDK consumption and reproducibility. "
"Explain each difference in Flash, RAM or symbols between equivalent "
"configurations using the same toolchain. Record a performance target as met "
"only when repeated p95 measurements, commands and artifacts all meet the "
"applicable criteria."

msgid "可独立验收的任务清单"
msgstr "Implementation checklist and acceptance criteria"

msgid ""
"以下 28 项细化 BR1–BR7。首批交付 BR1 和 BR4.1，配置维护者同时推进 BR3，验证维护者同步推进 "
"BR7.1–BR7.3。BR7.3 的影响范围切换依赖 BR7.1。BR5.2 的正式切换依赖 BR7.1 和 BR7.4，BR5.3 "
"的完整验收还需 BR7.3。相邻任务可合为一次提交，每次提交都要保留可运行的入口与适用的失败用例。"
msgstr ""
"The following 28 tasks break down BR1–BR7. Deliver BR1 and BR4.1 first. "
"Configuration maintainers can work on BR3 at the same time, and "
"verification maintainers can begin BR7.1–BR7.3. Switching to impact-based"
" selection in BR7.3 depends on BR7.1. Switching the SDK packaging rules "
"in BR5.2 depends on BR7.1 and BR7.4. Full acceptance of BR5.3 also "
"requires BR7.3. Adjacent tasks can share a commit if each commit retains "
"a working entry point and the relevant failure cases."

msgid "BR1 建立可比较的起点"
msgstr "BR1 Establish a comparable baseline"

msgid ""
"**BR1.1 固定输入与环境。** 在已有计时报告中登记 revision、主机、CMake、Ninja、编译器、并发、缓存和 "
"preset。将启明 F407 裸机、同板 FreeRTOS、Native、CPU Runtime、搬迁 SDK "
"登记为五个代表场景，每项实验注明适用场景。"
msgstr ""
"**BR1.1 Fix the inputs and environment.** Record the revision, host, "
"CMake, Ninja, compiler, concurrency, cache settings and preset in the "
"existing timing report. Register five representative scenarios: Qiming "
"F407 bare metal, FreeRTOS on that board, Native, CPU Runtime and a "
"relocated SDK. Identify which scenarios each experiment covers."

msgid ""
"**BR1.2 分开计算工作与等待。** 同一固件分别执行首次配置、首次构建、无修改、单个私有 C 变更、TOML 变更、删除 "
"BIN。保留命令退出码、墙钟时间、编译和链接边、ELF/map 与预算结果。trace 用于数查询次数，耗时用关闭 trace 的独立样本。"
msgstr ""
"**BR1.2 Separate work from elapsed time.** Use one firmware target to "
"measure initial configuration, first build, an unchanged build, a change "
"to one private C file, a TOML change and recovery after deleting the BIN."
" Record command exit codes, wall time, compile and link edges, the ELF "
"and map, and budget results. Use tracing to count queries and separate "
"runs without tracing to measure elapsed time."

msgid ""
"**BR1.3 固定门禁比较集。** 复用 B01 的 50 次提交回放，分别统计 testing、configure、ci、workflows "
"的选中模块及原因。真实驱动和单板变更各积累至少 30 个暖态样本，报告样本数、中位数、P95（升序第 ceil(0.95 × n) "
"项）、最大值、扩大检查范围的频率和 CPU 成本。保留失败与主机争用记录。"
msgstr ""
"**BR1.3 Fix the sample used to compare gates.** Reuse B01’s replay of 50 "
"commits. Report the modules selected and the reason for each selection in"
" the testing, configure, ci and workflows suites. Collect at least 30 "
"warm samples each for real driver changes and single-board changes. "
"Report the sample count, median, P95 (the item at rank ceil(0.95 × n) in "
"ascending order), maximum, frequency of expanding the scope of checks, "
"and CPU cost. Retain records of failures and host contention."

msgid "BR2 简化生产入口"
msgstr "BR2 Simplify the production entry point"

msgid ""
"**BR2.1 整理根装配顺序。** 在 BR1 后，把根 CMake 中可选的工作负载、测量与测试接线移入已有 Workload "
"或测试入口。分别用平台自身和外部应用配置，确认原有目标名、preset 和显式链接组件的用法仍有效。"
msgstr ""
"**BR2.1 Clarify the root assembly sequence.** After BR1, move optional "
"workload, measurement and test wiring from the root CMake file to the "
"existing Workload or test entry points. Configure both the platform and "
"an external application. Verify that existing target names, presets and "
"explicit component linking still work."

msgid ""
"**BR2.2 统一平台属性合同。** 对照根入口发布的 11 个属性与 Firmware 消费端，集中维护属性名称和必需条件。分别验证 "
"Native、物理固件和 Runtime。物理 provider 缺启动输入时应给出可定位的配置错误，外部应用编译命令中不应出现厂商私有头目录。"
msgstr ""
"**BR2.2 Unify the platform property contract.** Compare the 11 properties"
" published by the root entry point with the properties consumed by "
"Firmware. Maintain the names and conditions that make them mandatory in "
"one place. Check Native, physical firmware and Runtime separately. A "
"physical provider missing a startup input must emit a configuration "
"diagnostic that identifies the problem. External application compile "
"commands must keep vendor-private include directories out of the search "
"path."

msgid ""
"**BR2.3 按语言和工作负载发现工具。** 检查 ARM 工具链的 g++ 与 size 查找条件。用纯 C/ASM 固件、实际链接的 C++"
" 外部应用以及资源度量命令各跑一次。缺少选中功能所需工具时，诊断应指明工具与触发入口。"
msgstr ""
"**BR2.3 Discover tools for the selected languages and workload.** Review "
"when the ARM toolchain looks for g++ and size. Exercise a C/ASM-only "
"firmware build, an external C++ application that actually links, and the "
"resource measurement command. If a selected feature requires a missing "
"tool, the diagnostic must identify the tool and the entry point that "
"requested it."

msgid "BR3 一次交付控制器选择"
msgstr "BR3 Publish each controller selection once"

msgid ""
"**BR3.1 明确投影字段。** 从现有查询调用者反推其消费的类别、实例与模式，区分按类别和按控制器查询，记录空集语义。选择结果由 IR "
"派生，驱动源码列表与目标依赖由所属 CMake 声明。"
msgstr ""
"**BR3.1 Define the projection fields.** Inspect existing query callers to"
" determine which classes, instances and modes they consume. Distinguish "
"class-level queries from queries for one controller and document what an "
"empty result means. Derive the selection from the IR. Keep driver source "
"lists and target dependencies in their owning CMake files."

msgid ""
"**BR3.2 迁移 UART 与 SPI。** 在已有 emission 和 selection "
"文件中输出试点字段，覆盖两个同类控制器选择不同模式、重复模式去重、空配置，以及含分隔字符的输入被安全编码或拒绝。原子发布失败后不得留下混合配置。"
msgstr ""
"**BR3.2 Migrate UART and SPI.** Emit the initial fields through the "
"existing emitter and selection file. Cover two controllers of the same "
"class using different modes, deduplication of repeated modes, an empty "
"configuration, and safe encoding or rejection of inputs containing "
"separator characters. A failed atomic publication must never leave a "
"mixture of configurations."

msgid ""
"**BR3.3 迁移其余调用者。** 试点的选编对象、定义和链接结果等价后，再逐组切换 F4 "
"驱动。移除查询助手前搜索全部消费者，确认正常固件配置中 ControllerModes 对 resolved.json 的读取数由 35 降至 "
"0。"
msgstr ""
"**BR3.3 Migrate the remaining callers.** After the pilot confirms "
"equivalent object selection, definitions and link results, migrate the "
"remaining F4 drivers in groups. Search for all consumers before removing "
"a query helper. Confirm that reads of resolved.json by ControllerModes "
"during normal firmware configuration drop from 35 to 0."

msgid ""
"**BR3.4 检查等价性和实际收益。** 同工具链、同选项比较实际目标闭包、符号、向量、Flash/RAM "
"与无跟踪配置耗时。相同输入再次生成时输出时间戳稳定；受影响模式变化时，新增和移除的编译单元与预期一致。"
msgstr ""
"**BR3.4 Check equivalence and measure the gain.** With the same toolchain"
" and options, compare the actual target closure, symbols, vectors, "
"Flash/RAM and untraced configuration time. Generating again from "
"identical inputs must preserve output timestamps. After a mode change, "
"the translation units added or removed must match the expected selection."

msgid "BR4 修复热构建和失效边界"
msgstr "BR4 Fix warm builds and dependency invalidation"

msgid ""
"**BR4.1 修复调用方。** 先改 tdd_gate 的无条件 "
"configure，再同步外部示例仓库的构建入口。首次构建创建所需目录；同源码、preset、工具链、配置参数与 SDK "
"身份的热构建直接执行既有目标。源码或 SDK 路径切换、配置中断、并发进入同一目录分别有回归。"
msgstr ""
"**BR4.1 Fix the callers.** Address the unconditional configure in "
"tdd_gate first, then update the build entry point in the external "
"examples repository. A first build creates the required directories. A "
"warm build using the same source, preset, toolchain, configuration "
"arguments and SDK identity invokes the existing target directly. Cover "
"changes of source or SDK path, interrupted configuration, and concurrent "
"use of one directory."

msgid ""
"**BR4.2 验证配置与编译失效。** 用同一入口依次修改普通 C、私有头、板级事实和 TOML，再新增或删除被选事实。普通 C "
"只编译受影响对象，事实变更重新求解，无效输入失败。比较文件内容相同而工具实现有变时的重配、重编和重链接次数。"
msgstr ""
"**BR4.2 Check configuration and compilation dependencies.** Use the same "
"entry point to change a C source, private header, board fact and TOML in "
"turn, then add or remove a selected fact. A simple C change recompiles "
"the affected objects. A fact change triggers resolution, and invalid "
"input fails. When the configuration tool changes but its output content "
"stays the same, compare the number of configurations, compilations and "
"links."

msgid ""
"**BR4.3 拆清链接与预算依赖。** 在 Firmware "
"中列清对象、链接脚本、预算、检查器和报告各自的依赖。只收紧预算至镜像占用以下时，直接构建该固件必须返回失败，旧通过记录失效；恢复合法预算后同一命令成功。链接脚本内容实质变化应重新链接。"
msgstr ""
"**BR4.3 Separate link inputs from budget checks.** In Firmware, identify "
"the dependencies of the objects, linker script, budget, checker and "
"report. Lower only the budget below current image usage. Building that "
"firmware target directly must fail and invalidate the previous passing "
"record. Restore a valid budget and rerun the same command successfully. A"
" material change to the linker script must cause a relink."

msgid ""
"**BR4.4 逐项恢复交付产物。** 在独立树中分别删除已声明的 BIN、map "
"和资源报告，逐次直接构建原固件目标，检查恢复内容与预算状态。允许为重建 map 重新链接。无修改场景始终要求零编译、零链接。"
msgstr ""
"**BR4.4 Recover each delivery artifact.** In an isolated build tree, "
"delete the declared BIN, map and resource report one at a time. Build the"
" original firmware target after each deletion and check the recovered "
"content and budget status. Relinking to recover a map is valid. An "
"unchanged build must always run zero compilations and zero links."

msgid "BR5 将 MCU 差异留在所属包"
msgstr "BR5 Keep MCU differences within their packages"

msgid ""
"**BR5.1 迁移家族选择。** 在 BR3 投影稳定后，清点公共生成器中的 STM32 器件、startup "
"和特定模式假设。把已有语义对应的数据放入选中家族或 binding，家族私有目标消费这些数据。使用现有 F4 场景核对宏、HAL "
"源码、启动向量、内存布局与 ABI。"
msgstr ""
"**BR5.1 Migrate family-specific selections.** Once the BR3 projection is "
"stable, list assumptions about STM32 devices, startup and particular "
"modes in the common generator. Move data for existing semantics to the "
"selected family or binding, where private family targets consume it. "
"Check the macros, HAL sources, startup vector, memory layout and ABI "
"against existing F4 scenarios."

msgid ""
"**BR5.2 迁移 SDK 必备文件规则。** 由选中包声明精确头文件、启动源、供应商依赖和许可，通用打包器验证完整性。用搬迁 SDK "
"链接另一精确 F4 料号，再删去其专属启动源，要求校验失败。未选厂商依赖不应进入导出包。"
msgstr ""
"**BR5.2 Migrate SDK required-file rules.** Have the selected package "
"declare the exact device headers, startup source, vendor dependencies and"
" licenses. The generic packager checks their integrity. Link another "
"exact F4 part using a relocated SDK, remove that part’s startup source "
"and require the check to fail. The export must omit dependencies of "
"unselected vendors."

msgid ""
"**BR5.3 验证两个接入层次。** 单改 PCB 引脚时只动板级事实和 assembly，验证合法接线和冲突；同家族同 IP "
"料号检验封装引脚、内存、路由、精确器件头和向量。利用两块 F407 及既有 F411、F446、F479 软件参考，要求公共 resolver、根"
" CMake 和打包器新增型号分支数为零。"
msgstr ""
"**BR5.3 Verify two levels of onboarding.** For a PCB-only pin change, "
"edit board facts and the assembly and check a valid connection and a "
"conflict. For another part in the same family with the same IP, verify "
"its package pins, memory, routes, exact device header and vectors. Use "
"two F407 boards and the existing F411, F446 and F479 software references."
" The number of new part-specific branches in the common resolver, root "
"CMake and packager must be zero."

msgid ""
"**BR5.4 验证包隔离与新家族准入。** 先用外置 provider "
"测包标识冲突、搬迁与私有依赖隔离。未来真实新家族或厂商接入时，以启动、时钟、GPIO、UART、精确工具链链接和独立 SDK "
"应用贯通首条路径。另增无关家族后，既有 F4 私有改动选中的 ARM 目标集合应保持一致。"
msgstr ""
"**BR5.4 Verify package isolation and admission of a new family.** Use an "
"external provider to test package identity collisions, relocation and "
"isolation of private dependencies. When a real new family or vendor is "
"introduced, exercise startup, clocks, GPIO, UART, a link using the exact "
"toolchain, and a standalone SDK application as the first end-to-end path."
" After adding an unrelated family, private F4 changes must select the "
"same ARM targets as before."

msgid "BR6 仅实施收益明确的可选优化"
msgstr "BR6 Apply optional optimizations with measurable benefits"

msgid ""
"**BR6.1 度量组件加载。** "
"记录最小应用中组件目录的配置时间与实际消费目标。只在收益可重复且外部应用仍能显式链接公共组件时才延迟加载。公共组件名、目标映射和 SDK "
"准备入口分别只有一个维护位置。"
msgstr ""
"**BR6.1 Measure component loading.** For a minimal application, record "
"configuration time spent in component directories and the targets "
"actually consumed. Defer loading only when the saving is repeatable and "
"external applications can still link public components explicitly. "
"Maintain public component names, target mappings and SDK preparation "
"entry points in one place each."

msgid ""
"**BR6.2 评估同配置多固件的启动对象。** 比较双固件的源、编译定义、ABI、目录属性和实际命令。条件相同时试验共享四个启动对象，每个 "
"ELF 独立链接和检查。若无可辨别收益或向量、段布局变化，记录结论并维持原实现。"
msgstr ""
"**BR6.2 Evaluate startup objects shared by firmware targets with one "
"configuration.** Compare sources, compile definitions, ABI, directory "
"properties and actual commands for two firmware targets. Where they "
"match, trial sharing the four startup objects. Link and check each ELF "
"independently. If the gain is indistinguishable or the vectors or section"
" layout change, record the result and retain the current implementation."

msgid "BR7 精简四个工具域并验收交付"
msgstr "BR7 Streamline the four tooling suites and verify delivery"

msgid ""
"**BR7.1 实现按变更选检查。** BR1 后即可在现有 run_tool_tests 和 change_paths "
"中复用变更前后依赖集合的并集，先支持私有驱动、板卡及 assembly。测试共享头、重命名、删除和缺失 "
"depfile。依赖不明确时扩大到家族、工具域或完整验证，并在报告中给出原因。"
msgstr ""
"**BR7.1 Select checks from the change.** After BR1, use the union of "
"dependencies before and after the change in the existing run_tool_tests "
"and change_paths code. Start with private drivers, boards and assemblies."
" Test shared headers, renames, deletions and missing depfiles. For "
"uncertain dependencies, expand to the family, the tooling suite or full "
"verification and record the reason in the report."

msgid ""
"**BR7.2 压缩 testing 和 configure 的重复工作。** 同批不可变 fixture 按内容、根路径与包身份复用；合并相同 "
"EXTI、SPI factory 或 SDK "
"选择准备。每删除一项测试，记录原故障、保留测试和触发该测试的变更，再注入一次故障证明仍能捕获。保留共享资源冲突和配置发布中断用例。"
msgstr ""
"**BR7.2 Remove duplicate work in testing and configure.** Within a batch,"
" reuse immutable fixtures with the same content, root path and package "
"identity. Consolidate identical preparation for EXTI, SPI factories or "
"SDK selection. For each removed test, record its original fault, the "
"retained test and the changes that select it. Inject the fault once to "
"prove it is still detected. Retain cases for shared resource conflicts "
"and interrupted configuration publication."

msgid ""
"**BR7.3 压缩 ci 和 workflows 的重复工作。** 工作流改动运行相关真实入口与策略校验；普通板卡提交按 B04 检查使用它的 "
"assembly。完整能力扫描保留一份在集成层。对比四个工具域的模块选择、CPU 时间和端到端等待，避免同一检查被多个包装层重复执行。"
msgstr ""
"**BR7.3 Remove duplicate work in ci and workflows.** Workflow changes run"
" the relevant real entry points and policy checks. For ordinary board "
"commits, use B04 to check the assemblies that consume that board. Retain "
"a single full capability scan at integration. Compare module selection, "
"CPU time and end-to-end latency across the four tooling suites, and "
"remove repeated execution of the same check by multiple wrappers."

msgid ""
"**BR7.4 选择 SDK 外部消费者。** verify_consumers 从现有计划按名称选择，未知名称立即失败。用 TMP117 "
"变更验证 Native、F407 两条搬迁后的消费路径。公共 ABI、锁或导出策略变更扩大范围，正式交付保留全部已声明消费者和消费后完整性验证。"
msgstr ""
"**BR7.4 Select external SDK consumers.** Have verify_consumers select "
"named consumers from the existing plan and reject an unknown name "
"immediately. Use a TMP117 change to verify both the Native and F407 "
"consumer paths after relocation. Expand the checks for changes to the "
"public ABI, locks or export policy. Formal delivery retains every "
"declared consumer and verifies integrity after consumption."

msgid ""
"**BR7.5 引入有界并发。** 工具 fixture "
"去重后，共享主机并发预算，串行修改同一构建目录，每次运行独立写结果。比较串行、并行的模块与用例集合，注入 worker "
"失败、超时和取消，要求真实退出状态与子进程清理正确。"
msgstr ""
"**BR7.5 Introduce bounded concurrency.** After eliminating repeated "
"fixture preparation, use a shared host concurrency limit. Serialize "
"mutations of the same build directory and give each run its own results. "
"Compare the module and case sets from serial and parallel runs. Inject "
"worker failure, timeout and cancellation to verify actual exit status and"
" child process cleanup."

msgid ""
"**BR7.6 对照完整门禁。** 在相同提交上对照新增的快速选择与完整集成，注入错误引脚、漏掉共享头依赖、错误 DMA 路由、过期 SDK "
"导出、错误启动向量。每种故障必须由适用快路径直接捕获或由自动扩大的检查捕获；漏检即恢复对应规则的较宽范围。"
msgstr ""
"**BR7.6 Compare with the full gate.** Compare the new focused selection "
"with full integration at the same commit. Inject an invalid pin, a "
"missing shared-header dependency, an incorrect DMA route, a stale SDK "
"export and an incorrect startup vector. Each fault must be caught by the "
"applicable focused checks or by automatically expanded checks. If a fault"
" escapes, restore the broader scope of the corresponding rule."

msgid ""
"**BR7.7 验收日常反馈时间。** 在 BR1.3 定义的代表样本上，以整条本地门禁确认普通驱动 P95 不超过 180 秒、单板变更含实际 "
"ARM 链接 P95 不超过 300 秒。分别报告 cold、warm 与完整发布耗时。超预算时按阶段耗时定位后再决定下一项优化。"
msgstr ""
"**BR7.7 Verify everyday feedback latency.** Use the representative "
"samples defined in BR1.3. For the complete local gate, require P95 at or "
"below 180 seconds for ordinary driver changes and 300 seconds for a "
"single-board change that includes a real ARM link. Report cold, warm and "
"full release times separately. If a budget is exceeded, locate the "
"expensive stage before selecting the next optimization."

msgid ""
"**BR7.8 切换默认入口。** 当前 F4 样本与故障对照通过后，更新 AGENTS、开发流程、CI 条件以及示例用法。复验源码消费、搬迁 "
"SDK、正式离线复现。按原有结果格式声明实际执行范围，保留旧规则回退路径至首批对照完成；新家族的正式资格随该家族单独验收。"
msgstr ""
"**BR7.8 Switch the default entry points.** Once the current F4 samples "
"and injected-fault comparisons pass, update AGENTS, the development "
"workflow, CI conditions and examples. Recheck source consumption, the "
"relocated SDK and formal offline reproducibility. Record the scope "
"actually executed in the existing result format. Keep a way to restore "
"the previous rules until the first set of comparisons is complete. "
"Qualify each new family independently when it is introduced."
